Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.95,0:00:04.58,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hey, what color do you \Nthink Hori-senpai would like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:09.23,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs14\shad0\pos(250.909,94.727)\c&H243062&\3c&H599BBC&\frz6.95}Chocolate Recipes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:09.23,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I've seen her with red \Nand pink things before...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:12.24,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Maybe that would be \Nbetter than blue or white.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:15.49,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.43,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Miyamura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:18.49,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.59,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you're her boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:21.79,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:24.87,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,So what color does she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:26.75,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sawada-san, please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:28.86,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Valentine's Day is almost here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:34.01,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs36\b1\i1\c&H2937B0&\3c&H171F5D&\4c&HD4E5F4&}SNAP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:31.99,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,and I can't wrap her present unless \NI know what color ribbon to use!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:34.01,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Why did you come to ask me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:36.62,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Maybe you just don't understand \Nhow important it is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:39.58,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,for a present to be as cute \Nand appealing as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:42.77,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe I don't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:44.89,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The wrapping, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:47.40,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Miyamura, don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.80,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Are you planning to just \Nlet the shop wrap it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.87,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Well, not that it's any of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:57.41,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,But the shop's wrapping is cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.94,0:00:59.74,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How do you do it, Sawada?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:02.91,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hmm, what color should I pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:07.01,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san likes red and orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.17,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:13.96,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,1)\fnArial\b1\bord0\an8\fs16\shad1\c&H32618D&\3c&H89929F&\4c&H35546C&\pos(490.181,76.751)}Chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:13.96,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,This wrapping is simple and \Nlooks cute, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:47.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\pos(236.364,252.545)\c&H9BB3AA&\3c&H425B44&\b1}Katagiri High School
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:50.69,Main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,Good morning, Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:51.68,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:53.02,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.89,0:02:59.94,Main - Italics,Sawada,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I need to figure out \Nwhere to buy a ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:10.92,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Kyon-Kyon, you're gonna give \NMiyamura-kun a Valentine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:14.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Nope, he said he's making one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:17.66,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun's family\Nowns a cake shop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:19.42,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I bet he'll make something really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:22.04,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,What about you, Kyon-Kyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.34,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:26.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I don't think I can make a very good dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:29.09,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh. That's kinda selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:29.93,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord3\c&H8B877F&\3c&H28180C&\frz339.6\pos(522.181,59.091)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:33.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I mean, mine would pale \Nin comparison to Miyamura's,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.82,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,1)\fnArial\b1\fs18\shad0\fay-.5\pos(156.363,129.637)\c&H20272C&\3c&HF0F1FD&}Famous Pâtissier
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:36.82,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,and it won't feel right to give him \None from a different shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:36.82,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnArial\b1\fs18\shad0\fay-.4\c&H424261&\3c&HEEF2F4&\pos(509.817,248.91)}Big-Chain Bakery
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.66,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,That's the wrong way to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:45.32,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,1)\fnArial\b1\an8\shad0\bord3\fs16\c&H303644&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(277.001,60.605)}The last cake she made was burned to a crisp\N\N{\fnComic Sans MS\i1}Smolder Smolder
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:42.38,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,He'll be so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:45.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,He doesn't want to be gifted\N a crappy dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:49.71,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I think he'd be happy\Nto receive anything you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:55.59,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I still think a good dessert would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.59,Main - Top,Sawada,0,0,0,,The one on this page, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:56.59,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.98,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, Sawada-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:59.59,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\an8\frz18.63\c&H785DD9&\3c&H1F222F&\4c&HDFE7E2&\b1\pos(138.908,133.273)}WHIP
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:03:59.59,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.26,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You over here for class?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:01.74,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(114,380)\fnComic Sans MS\an8\i1\pos(267.637,21.273)\b1\c&H5BA4D9&\3c&H4D3B93&\4c&HE8F4F1&}Zoom
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:03.43,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,No, I just needed to show Miyamura something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:06.36,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,But, say, it's almost time, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:08.31,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I'll do my best this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:09.10,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.85,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I got Miyamura to tell me—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:11.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H785DD9&\3c&H1D175E&\4c&HDFE7E2&\b1\fs48\pos(83.636,214)\frz17.45}WH
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:11.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H785DD9&\3c&H1D175E&\4c&HDFE7E2&\b1\fs48\frz17.45\pos(520.727,116.545)}AP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:11.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H785DD9&\3c&H1D175E&\4c&HDFE7E2&\b1\fs48\pos(83.636,214)\frz17.45}WH
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:11.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H785DD9&\3c&H1D175E&\4c&HDFE7E2&\b1\fs48\frz17.45\pos(520.727,116.545)}AP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:14.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H28283D&\3c&HE3EDEE&}Wriggle Struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:15.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Come on, Sawada-san.\NYou don't want to be late for class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:16.87,Main - Top,Sawada,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:19.02,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I can't have her finding out \NI can't decide on the gift wrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:19.02,Main - Top,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:21.19,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:22.52,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:24.61,Main - Italics,Sawada,0,0,0,,Gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:27.38,Main - Italics,Sawada,0,0,0,,He could be a little more understanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:30.44,Main - Italics,Sawada,0,0,0,,I'm getting mad just thinking about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:32.37,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Um, Sawada-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.37,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:41.13,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Um, you're friends with \Nthe third-years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:43.82,Main - Italics,Sawada,0,0,0,,This again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.15,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.14,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.89,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Valentine's Day is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:50.79,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:52.14,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,So I was, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.65,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,There's a third-year boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(470,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs14\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(377.364,149.331)}Yanagi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(470,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\an1\fs12\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(485.091,51.818)}Well... he's pretty cool
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(470,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs14\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(502.455,289.695)}Miyamura
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(470,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\an9\fs12\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(624,142.727)}Well... he's not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.46,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:01.39,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:03.40,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You mean Yanagi or Miyamura, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.15,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I can pass a present to either one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:08.66,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are Yanagi and Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.16,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\an1\fs12\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(175.272,125.272)}An underclassman\Nsays she likes him,\N I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.16,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs14\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(218.819,215.513)}Ishikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.16,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\an1\fs12\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(151.999,280.908)}Well... he stands out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.16,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs14\c&H2E343B&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(109.728,296.968)}Sengoku
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.90,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Ishikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:16.38,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.17,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, I don't know them either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:23.52,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Sorry, then it might be a boy I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:25.82,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.93,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,He comes to school in a hoodie all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:32.43,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Iura...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:33.14,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,190)\fnArial\b1\an8\fax.2\c&HE7CB89&\3c&H967425&\4c&HDFEBED&}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:34.18,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Wait, Iura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.59,0:05:39.25,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. Do you also happen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:41.46,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:44.82,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I-It's just... Iura?\NThe loudmouth in the hoodie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:45.69,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:54.45,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs18\c&H181D20&\3c&HEEF4EF&\pos(552.637,208.24)}Rude
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:49.05,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:49.91,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:52.10,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,So his name is Iura-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:54.45,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Gosh, I'm blushing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:58.10,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I've never spoken to him, and he \Nprobably doesn't know who I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:06:02.71,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,190)\fnArial\b1\an8\fax.2\c&H90F7F7&\3c&H22427C&\bord3\4c&HDFEBED&}GUSH GUSH GUSH
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:00.99,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,but I thought giving him \Nsome chocolate wouldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:02.96,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,He won't be here next year anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:06.10,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,O-Okay, it's all good. Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.47,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Will he still accept it \Nif he has a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:10.95,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,He doesn't have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.19,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:13.69,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Not even secretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:14.72,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:17.16,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Do you want to date him? Why not tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.72,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,D-Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:23.48,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I j-just want to give him \Nsome chocolate. Th-That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:28.24,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:31.47,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask anyone in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:34.49,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I really wanted to tell someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:39.25,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Talking about it gets me sort of flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:45.45,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I-I'll listen, even if I can't do much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:49.26,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'd like you to ask what \Nkind of chocolate he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.86,0:06:53.60,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You really only want to \Ngive him some chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:54.26,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:57.69,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,So you respect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.68,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,That's it. That sounds right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:01.77,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fay-.25\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\shad0\c&H59585B&\3c&HDDE1E1&\frx0\fry336\pos(404.971,75.195)}Student Council
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:05.27,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,The supermarkets and convenience stores are \Ngonna start pushing Valentine's Day stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:06.95,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I feel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:11.67,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,But since you're probably gonna get a ton\Nof chocolate and I'm not, I {\i1}don't{\i0} feel you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:14.03,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You just said you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:16.76,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Anyway, what are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:17.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:20.04,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Practicing tying a tie, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.32,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Miyamura can already tie a tie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.56,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:25.48,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:28.05,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,770)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\fs36\pos(154.182,59.818)\c&H3A3846&\3c&HEBEEF2&}Messy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:30.41,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wait... It's not cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:31.80,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What's this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:35.30,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I thought I followed the directions \Nfrom Sawada's magazine...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.92,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What even is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:40.52,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Damn, the knot's too tight! \NI can't get it out, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:43.56,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Sawada-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.04,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.11,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Want me to get Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:47.44,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:48.32,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sawada?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.74,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I'm here to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:52.97,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Iura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.30,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:55.15,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:58.95,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Um, do you like... chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.71,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an6\fnArial\fs36\b1\i1\c&H2D26C6&\3c&H2B294D&\4c&HF5F7F9&\pos(609.428,178.857)}S\NH\NO\NC\NK
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.96,Main - Italics,Iura,0,0,0,,C-Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.21,Main - Italics,Iura,0,0,0,,in preparation for Valentine's Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:10.71,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,S-Sure, I like chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:12.34,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Any flavor in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:13.68,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I like them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:16.45,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I don't have any allergies,\N and I can do sweet or bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:20.72,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Everyone can see how desperate you are, Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:22.73,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Any kind of chocolate is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.35,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:25.10,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\fs20\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\pos(308.364,51.818)\c&HA48D5F&\3c&HEDF7E5&}Glance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:25.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\fs20\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&HA48D5F&\3c&HEDF7E5&\pos(151.273,163.818)}Glance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.61,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Any kind at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.75,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sawada-san, are you \Ngonna give Shu chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:33.53,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I thought it'd just be Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:36.77,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,H-H-Hey! Don't discourage her, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:39.52,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Don't let them give you a hard time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:43.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\i1\shad0\bord0\b1\fnArial\c&H86432D&}Recoil
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.87,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Why would {\i1}I{\i0} give chocolate to Iura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.37,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(680,1)\an6\fnArial\fs36\shad0\bord4\b1\i1\c&HF3F8EE&\3c&HD9F4CB&\4c&HF5F7F9&\pos(622,180)}S\NH\NO\NC\NK
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:47.35,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.38,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm heading back to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.64,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:09:00.14,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(181.001,268.604)}Confused
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.99,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,She's toying with your heart, Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:58.64,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I knew something didn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:05.14,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,He said he likes any kind of chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:09.39,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,That's good. That means I can \Ntake my time picking some out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.39,0:09:11.49,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,There are so many kinds, it's hard to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.65,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I didn't expect so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:16.30,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:17.25,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:20.91,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I'm giving someone chocolate, too, \Nso I wanted to see what they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:23.41,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Who are you giving chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:25.12,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I-It's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:36.43,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,If I'm not able to give it to him, \Nwill you accept it instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.43,0:09:38.46,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:39.63,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You're doing this for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:42.20,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.23,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Valentine's Day is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:01.99,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,I think he'd be happy\Nto receive anything you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.15,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.00,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.455,133.273)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H5C5963&\3c&HE0E3E0&\b1}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:08.00,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:12.00,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What's the easiest chocolate dessert to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:16.83,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Oh, are you making \Na Valentine for Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:19.73,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Shh! Someone might hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.73,0:10:22.26,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's okay. There's no one else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:27.52,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I figured it would be best \Nnot to ask the person I'm giving it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:33.02,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I know I won't be able to make\Nsomething nice like they sell in shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:37.53,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,But if there's a dessert I can't screw up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:42.11,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Am I really gonna give the simplest dessert \Npossible to a cake shop owner's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:47.29,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnArial\b1\an8\shad0\fs16\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(545.364,204.604)}Conflicted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:45.40,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,As simple as possible, but still delicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:48.54,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.54,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad0\c&H52597C&\3c&HEAE8EE&\pos(278.545,157.272)\frz16.5\frx14\fry2}Simple Desserts to Make at Home
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:55.53,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,A recipe book? I didn't know \Nthe library had those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:56.68,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:59.30,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,And this one's easy to follow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.19,0:11:03.80,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,When I started making desserts, \NI borrowed this book a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:08.31,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Chocolate desserts are... here, on this page.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:10.48,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I think this one might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:13.02,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Kono-san's desserts are fantastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:15.82,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&H52597C&\3c&HD6E1E6&\frz16.06\move(256.727,61.272,246.545,53.999,1111,3260)}Simple Desserts to Make at Home
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:14.96,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,but I guess even she started somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:16.57,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(114,1)\an9\fnArial\fs48\b1\i1\bord4\shad3\c&HC388DF&\3c&H6E2D9F&\4c&HE4E7F0&}BAM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.32,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(114,1)\an5\fnArial\fs48\b1\i1\bord4\shad3\c&HD5D142&\3c&H9C6E28&\4c&HE4E7F0&}BOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.07,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(114,1)\fnArial\fs48\b1\i1\bord4\shad3\c&H4D95E7&\3c&H19208D&\4c&HE4E7F0&}BANG
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:19.28,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(114,270)\an8\fnArial\fs48\b1\i1\bord4\shad3\c&HB2EA59&\3c&H859536&\4c&HE4E7F0&}POW
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.67,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.95,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Kyoko-chan, can I eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:23.55,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:27.37,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,Honey, let Kyoko be when \Nshe's wielding a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:29.96,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Is she preparing for battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:33.96,Main,Sota,0,0,0,,Big Sis, what are you making?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:36.46,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, so wait over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.42,Main,Sota,0,0,0,,Is it a special occasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:39.98,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:42.47,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm just practicing for Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:45.65,Main,Sota,0,0,0,,She says she's practicing for \NValentine's Day with that scary face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:47.13,Main,Yuna,0,0,0,,Is she gonna fight someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:50.98,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Dang it! I'll bring it to you when it's done,\N so let me concentrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:54.41,Main,Sota,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:59.99,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I only look scary because \NI'm taking this so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:05.62,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura will like it more \Nif it tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:17.00,Main,Sota,0,0,0,,It's not really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:22.01,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I... I... I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:23.35,Main,Yuna,0,0,0,,Sota, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:26.66,Main,Yuna,0,0,0,,I-I'll have one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:28.51,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:31.07,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,I'll try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:33.02,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,I think I will as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.27,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:40.20,Main,Yuna,0,0,0,,It's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.46,Main,Yuna,0,0,0,,I just can't eat a lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:44.03,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's not terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:48.35,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,I can see why Sota wouldn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:50.54,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,It's not too sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:52.89,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,It's perfect for me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.89,0:12:54.04,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,I'll have another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.04,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuri-chan's going for the biggest one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.04,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I-It's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.38,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,It depends on your taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:03.30,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(114,1)\fnArial\fs36\b1\i1\bord3\shad3\c&H2D57D5&\3c&H182F41&\4c&HE4E7F0&\pos(290.909,63.455)\frz356.9}BA-BAM
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:02.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me if it's good or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:08.30,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.182,112.909)\fnComic Sans MS\fs36\shad0\bord3\3c&HE2E8EA&\c&H1B2321&}Glooooom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:11.05,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:13.66,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I must be lacking taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.57,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,That kind of thinking won't get you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:23.07,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I don't think you need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:28.32,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Guys don't mind things a little bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:30.71,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Tell it to me straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:33.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I promise not to fly into a rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.33,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,You're already getting hysterical!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:39.09,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I didn't even cut them right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.01,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hori-san, remember what Remi said?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:48.09,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,He'll be happy to receive anything you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:55.34,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It not how it looks or how \Nit tastes that matters most.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:59.35,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,And personally, I like this chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.70,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It reminds me of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:05.83,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Kono-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:08.27,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hori-san, why are you behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:13.43,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,She's right. The most important thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:15.87,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Happy Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:17.78,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:18.72,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:20.77,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,J-Just so you know, \NI'm giving them to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:23.48,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I know. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:27.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Iura-kun! Here's your obligatory chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:29.13,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,At least say it's friend-to-friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:31.35,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Miyamura brand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:32.89,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Remember our shop's name, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:35.55,Main - Top,Male Student,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura, I want some, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:36.58,Main,Girl A,0,0,0,,Looks like Miyamura-kun brought more \Nchocolate than the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.55,0:14:36.58,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.04,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:39.74,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:42.12,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Can you come over today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:43.39,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:45.16,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Can I come after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:46.53,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:50.78,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,But I'm heading home early,\N so take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:53.62,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll stop by my place first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:57.24,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Let me know if it starts to \Nget dark. I'll come get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.52,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:00.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Then I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:05.63,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,It's gotta be chocolate. \NHe said he'd make me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:09.05,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,But he almost always comes to our place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:12.05,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\c&H26316F&\blur1\3c&HCCE1F3&}Giant Chocolate Fondue Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:12.05,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\shad0\bord0\pos(230.545,121.636)\c&H584976&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.05,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Did he make something huge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:14.97,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,What is it? I'm dying to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:17.06,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.31,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Happy Valentine's Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:21.31,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,This is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:23.46,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I worked really hard on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:24.93,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:27.32,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,So this is what she said\Nshe'd try her best on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.69,0:15:29.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:30.82,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:32.07,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:34.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I love the color of this ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:37.08,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm almost sad to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:41.58,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Miyamura told me what colors you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:45.59,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,He said you'd definitely like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:48.28,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I hated that I needed his help, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:52.15,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,What I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.15,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:58.24,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I love it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:03.70,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Maybe hoping to see someone you like \Nwith a happy look on their face
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:06.59,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,is what today is really about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:12.00,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Good, you're here! Package for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.11,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.94,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Chocolate delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:17.25,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm giving them to everyone, \Nso they're not very big,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.62,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,but they came out better than last year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:22.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(548.273,83.15)}Smells funny
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:25.15,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I'll eat mine at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:26.42,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,S-So will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:28.71,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't wait too long to eat them. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:31.47,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,It's like a storm passed through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:32.40,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.82,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:38.65,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:40.89,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Um, I didn't get a chance to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.89,0:16:42.05,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:46.31,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.31,0:16:47.95,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Thanks, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:50.90,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Well, look inside later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:52.74,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:56.13,Main - Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Is it okay to look inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.91,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs14\c&H515457&\frz353.3\pos(362.909,248.182)}Ishikawa-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.91,Main - Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,There are two boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:01.91,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs20\c&H3B4142&\frz341.7\pos(549.818,294)}Ishikawa-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:01.91,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs20\c&H3B4142&\frz341.7\pos(224.727,174.727)}Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:07.11,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kono-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.07,0:17:10.07,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,S-Sakura...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.06,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.43,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Am I early?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:23.67,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Nope, you're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:24.56,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.01,0:17:26.06,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:28.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,She should be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:35.54,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,What if he doesn't like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:43.52,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura's so nice. He'll probably \Nsay he likes them even if he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:45.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:47.46,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.96,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Happy Valentine's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:56.42,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,430)\pos(259.636,57.636)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\c&H3C2FAE&\3c&HDEE6F3&}Oooh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:56.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I tried making a Valentine cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:58.30,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It smells so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:17:59.23,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Can I eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:00.97,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Okay, I will! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:08.98,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Delicious as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.81,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:14.07,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Why? Were you worried about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:16.74,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Not worried exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:20.54,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Truth is, I couldn't decide how to wrap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I would've brought it to your house otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:28.25,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sorry that it's so plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:30.25,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord4\fs36\b1\i1\c&H1C192F&\3c&HDDDADB&\4c&HF5F7F9&\pos(22.571,181.143)}S\NH\NO\NC\NK
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:34.71,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I brought the chocolate I made \Nwithout any kind of wrapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:38.26,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(378.909,189.273)}Tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:38.26,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(519.273,243.818)}Tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:38.26,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(549.818,143.454)}Tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:38.26,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(586.182,49.636)}Tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:37.28,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Not at all... I really like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.26,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.01,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,It's too late to worry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:44.46,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Actually, I made something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:53.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(343.273,166)}Shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:53.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(335.273,73.636)}Shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:53.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(490.182,78)}Shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:53.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H986438&\3c&HEDF7E5&\b1\pos(403.637,43.091)}Shake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.91,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What? You made something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:51.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm sure you already know it won't be\Nnearly as good as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:53.15,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Why are you being so self-critical?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(114,100)\an8\fnArial\b1\i1\bord3\shad3\c&HD6A22C&\3c&H5B2320&\4c&HE4E7F0&\pos(176,20.182)}Droop
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:56.56,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wow, chocolate ganache.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:57.90,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I love ganache.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:18:59.67,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I should've known...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:04.16,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H896A50&\3c&HE6FCFB&\b1\pos(374.545,65.637)\frz12.33}Depressed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:04.16,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H516AE9&\3c&HE6FCFB&\b1\pos(242.909,72.182)\frz21.86}Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:04.16,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,On special occasions, you make \Nsomething by hand and wrap it with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.98,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I was only thinking about him eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:10.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, this plate is from your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:12.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Kinda puts me at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.42,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,He's eaten a bunch of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:18.06,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:19.15,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:20.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It's just sweet enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:22.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Want to try one, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.30,0:19:25.18,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Here. Say, "Aah."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.36,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:29.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:33.36,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,It's better than my practice ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:36.69,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It's hard to relax until you see \Nhow your partner reacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.51,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,So he felt the same way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:45.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How is the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:47.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's delicious, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:49.60,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You made it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.21,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.61,0:19:56.33,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to eat \Nwith you staring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:57.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:01.18,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Chocolate cake that \Nsimply melts in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:03.72,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Whipped cream that isn't too sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:05.71,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Just how I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:07.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What should I make next year?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:08.97,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's too soon for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.55,0:20:11.98,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You'll eat it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:15.62,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:18.73,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,It's something that only I'll get to taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.90,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What are you gonna make for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.11,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I don't need to make anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.11,0:20:27.39,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You were so cute, \Nlooking worried all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:28.83,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Don't mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How could I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.64,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura put his heart into that dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.52,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,It tasted like happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:06.01,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,1)\c&HC2A774&\3c&HF4F9ED&\shad0\an7\fs16\pos(469.385,317.744)}Next time\Npage.12 Hori's House
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.51,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Oh, Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:18.03,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,The third-years are going home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:19.76,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:23.01,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I just can't do it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.01,0:22:25.53,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I can't even talk to the boys in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:27.89,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,I'm just making up excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:33.87,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,All after you were such a big help...\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.52,0:22:35.79,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I can give it to—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.10,0:22:39.29,Main - Italics,Sawada,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:44.05,Main - Italics,Sawada,0,0,0,,She wanted to give it to him herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.05,0:22:46.46,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Now this will go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:49.24,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,But I was so excited, \Nand that was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:51.55,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:55.06,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Okay, then give me the chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:58.40,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You said I could have it \Nif you didn't give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:23:00.04,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,That way, it won't go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:01.56,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I'll eat all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:03.86,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:07.07,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,You'll really eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:09.82,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:12.23,Main,Maya,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.23,0:23:13.40,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:19.27,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,And this... is from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:22.05,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I bought it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.05,0:23:24.09,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I guess it's obligatory chocolate or whatever.
